From: "xuan.huang" <5563315+Huxpro@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 11:53:18 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] feat(motion): support transformTemplate

transformTemplate runs on every rendered frame on the main thread, but
consumer closures live in the background runtime. Main Thread Functions are
called directly with the latest transform values. Plain closures are
compiled once with placeholder values into literal parts and value slots,
verified against a real call on the first-frame values, and filled on the
main thread. The first frame calls the consumer template directly.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
